                                                "sense_id": "e684628f-da74-3caa-a934-0bc58563214f",
                                                "text": "So in that sense, if we want to talk about the timeline of what it would mean for Trump to be winning and reshifting the Constitutional order, part of what I think about is: If the neoliberal order is cracked, as Gerstle says it is, then the question is: What will succeed it?"
                                            }
